	(text "WIRE BY PIN NAME, NEVER BY NUMBER. U1 numbers are header positions: GPIO1 = pin 3, GPIO10 (SSR drive) = pin 12. Verify pads in the .kicad_pcb after layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 35.56 0)
		(effects
