		(uuid "24061a15-398f-d337-2b1d-f37240a89256")
	)
	(text "Divider 220k/10k = 23:1 (180k not stocked). Calibrate with testrig 'cal <V>'. C1 is not optional: sensing beside a kW oscillator (R-11)."
