	)
	(text "Phase 2 headers J7/J8/J9: footprints reserved, unpopulated. CAN stack (ADUM1201 + B0505S + SN65HVD230) is off-board - isolation required. INA228 shunt value is a PLACEHOLDER until VR-11 four-wire cal."
